disposition=reference only, not enforced

[Key NumPad1]
owner=NVDA
kind=conditional
what=previous character in review
context=everywhere, in NVDA's desktop layout with Num Lock off
interception=taken by NVDA before the app; the main arrow, Home, End and page keys still reach it
disposition=never bind as an app's only key; keypad navigation in a Homer grid is a convenience the main keys must duplicate

